    "overview": "ASS uses a compact, utilitarian shadcn interface: white and black work surfaces, monochrome actions, Geist and sharp corners. Thin rules and aligned records carry the hierarchy; orange appears in small identity, active-state and live-status details.\n\nThe shell stays quiet while the question, protocol and recorded evidence do the work. Progressive disclosure keeps configuration manageable. Light and dark themes preserve the same roles and density.",
